      "body": "The difference is add vs multiply. 3, 6, 9, 12 is arithmetic (+ 3): the 5th term is 3 + 4·3 = 15. But 3, 6, 12, 24 is geometric (× 2): the 5th term is 3 · 2⁴ = 48. Same start, very different growth.",
